WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.210
Welcome to the Federal Modernization
Workbook's developer workbook,

2
00:00:04.210 --> 00:00:06.075
Building Global Secure Access.

3
00:00:06.075 --> 00:00:11.737
This is Chapter 1: the decision,
licensing, and availability in GCC.

4
00:00:11.737 --> 00:00:15.793
A network control is adopted by a
written decision with exit criteria,

5
00:00:15.793 --> 00:00:18.589
not by turning on a toggle,
so the first code reads

6
00:00:18.589 --> 00:00:21.875
what the tenant holds and
checks the decision against it.

7
00:00:21.875 --> 00:00:26.068
We'll start from what Microsoft Learn
says, see what it leaves to you,

8
00:00:26.068 --> 00:00:31.100
read the kit's call list, its availability
table and nine checks, and walk two labs.

9
00:00:31.100 --> 00:00:35.640
One note before we begin: this chapter
has been reviewed and approved,

10
00:00:35.640 --> 00:00:39.290
and the code is illustrative,
tested against fixtures.
